		sections={
			{id=6714,title="Kings' Procession",body="The Spirit Kings animate in sequence, with one King attacking the players until defeated, at which time another King enters the fray. Defeated Kings become entirely incorporeal, but continue to bring one of their powerful abilities to bear periodically.$[!5,6\n\nOn Heroic difficulty, each Spirit King animates and joins the battle when its predecessor is brought below 30% of maximum health.$]"},
			{id=5841,title="Qiang the Merciless",body="When the players defeat the Warlord King, he remains in battle in a weakened state and only uses his Flanking Orders ability."},
			{id=5842,title="Flanking Orders",body="The Warlord King orders a flank, calling in a wave of Mogu attackers. These Flanking Mogu cast Overhand Strike, inflicting $117918s1 Physical damage to enemies in front of them within $117918A1 yards.\n\nThe Warlord King retains Flanking Orders after being defeated."},
			{id=5843,title="Massive Attacks",body="No single man or woman can stand against the brutal attacks of the Warlord King. His Massive Attacks inflict $117921s1 Physical damage, split among all enemies hit."},
			{id=5844,title="Annihilate",body="Qiang focuses on Annihilating his enemies in front of him, inflicting $117948s1 damage to enemies within $117948A1 yards."},
			{id=5845,title="Impervious Shield",body="The Warlord King uses his Impervious Shield, becoming immune to all attacks and spells. When struck with a harmful ability or spell during Impervious Shield, Qiang will retaliate with an extra attack.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=5835,title="Meng the Demented",body="When the players defeat the Mad King, he remains in battle in a weakened state and only uses his Maddening Shout ability."},
			{id=5836,title="Maddening Shout",body="The Maddening Shout of Meng the Demented causes all enemies to go mad, inflicting $117708s3 Shadow damage every $117708t3 sec. and causing all enemies to hate each other. Players regain their sanity after taking $117708s1 damage from another player.\n\nThe Mad King retains Maddening Shout after being defeated."},
			{id=5837,title="Crazed",body="The Mad King becomes more insane every $117737t1 sec. Crazed increases the Mad King's Physical damage dealt by a percentage equal to twice his current Insanity. When the Mad King reaches 100 Insanity, he switches personalities to Cowardice."},
			{id=5838,title="Cowardice",body="The Mad King becomes more insane every $117756t1 sec. Cowardice causes the Mad King to reflect damage equal to 50% of his current Insanity. When the Mad King reaches 100 Insanity, he switches personalities to Crazed."},
			{id=5839,title="Crazy Thought",body="A Crazy Thought crosses the Mad King's warped mind, increasing his Insanity by $117833s1."},
			{id=5840,title="Delirious",body="The Mad King enrages, doubling the rate he gains insanity.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=5846,title="Subetai the Swift",body="When the players defeat the Bandit King, he remains in battle in a weakened state and only uses his Pillage ability."},
			{id=5847,title="Pillage",body="The Bandit King charges a random player and Pillages all enemies within $118048A1 yards, stealing the victims' possessions. The Pillaged effect reduces the affected players' damage and healing done by $118048s1% and increases their Physical damage taken by $118048s3%.\n\nThe Bandit King retains Pillage after being defeated."},
			{id=5849,title="Volley",body="Subetai launches three Volleys in quick succession. The first inflicts $118094s1 Physical damage to enemies in a large cone in front of the caster, then $118105s1 Physical damage in a medium cone, and finally $118106s1 Physical damage in a small cone."},
			{id=5848,title="Rain of Arrows",body="The Bandit King fires a Rain of Arrows at the location of a random player, inflicting Pinned Down on all targets within the $118135A1 yard area. Pinned Down inflicts $118135s2 Physical damage every $118135t2 sec. until another player removes the arrow from the victim."},
			{id=5861,title="Pinning Arrow",body="The Pinning Arrow causes Pinned Down, inflicting $118135s2 Physical damage every $118135t2 sec. until a player destroys the Pinning Arrow."},
			{id=5850,title="Sleight of Hand",body="Damaging attacks against the Bandit King cause the attacker to suffer being Robbed Blind. The effect reduces damage and healing done by $118163s1% and reduces armor by $118163s3%. The Bandit King becomes vulnerable to Stun effects while using Sleight of Hand.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=5851,title="Robbed Blind",body="Robbed Blind reduces the target's damage and healing done by $118163s1% and increases their Physical damage taken by $118163s3%.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=5852,title="Zian of the Endless Shadow",body="When the players defeat the Sorcerer King, he remains in battle in a weakened state and only uses his Undying Shadows ability."},
			{id=5853,title="Undying Shadows",body="The Sorcerer King creates an Undying Shadow at the location of a random player. The Undying Shadow inflicts $117529s1 Shadow damage every $117514t1 sec to players within $117529A1 yards until destroyed.\n\nThe Sorcerer King retains Undying Shadows after being defeated."},
			{id=5854,title="Undying Shadow",body="The Undying Shadow inflicts $117529s1 Shadow damage every $117514t1 sec to players within $117529A1 yards until destroyed. An Undying Shadow fixates on the closest nearby player when the Sorcerer King summons it. After the Undying Shadow dies it starts to reform itself, creating Coalescing Shadows. After 30 seconds the Undying Shadow fully coalesces and reforms."},
			{id=5855,title="Coalescing Shadows",body="The Coalescing Shadows inflicts $117529s1 Shadow damage every $t1 sec. to players within $117529A1 yards. After 30 seconds the Undying Shadow fully coalesces and reforms."},
			{id=5856,title="Shadow Blast",body="The Sorcerer King launches a Shadow Blast at the location of a random player. The Shadow Blast inflicts $117633s1 Shadow damage upon impact to players within $117633A1 yards of the targeted location."},
			{id=5857,title="Charged Shadows",body="The Sorcerer King blasts a random player with Charged Shadows, inflicting $117685s1 Shadow damage to the target then chaining to further targets within 8 yards of each other."},
			{id=5858,title="Shield of Darkness",body="The Sorcerer King protects himself with a Shield of Darkness. The Shield inflicts $117701s1 Shadow damage to all enemies whenever a damaging ability lands on the Sorcerer King.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=5859,title="Darkness",body="Inflicts $117701s1 Shadow damage to all enemies.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
		},
	},
	[689]={
