		sections={
			{id=6122,title="Furious Swipe",body="Garalon performs a Furious Swipe to targets in a large cone in front of him, inflicting $122735s1 Physical damage. If Garalon fails to hit at least 2 targets with his Furious Swipe, he gains Fury."},
			{id=6265,title="Fury",body="Fury increases Garalon's damage dealt by $122754s1% and movement speed by $122754s3% for $122754d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=6266,title="Crush",body="Garalon crushes his foes, inflicting $122774s3 Physical damage to all players. Any player within $122774A2 yards receives an additional $122774s2 Physical damage as Garalon's body slams down upon them. Garalon's massive bulk also knocks down all players for $122774d. Garalon crushes foes whenever he detects their presence beneath him.$[!3,4\n\nIn Normal Difficulty, Garalon also crushes foes when Pheromones passes to a new target.$]$[!5,6\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty, Garalon periodically crushes foes.$]"},
			{id=6267,title="Pheromones",body="Garalon surrounds a player with powerful pheromones, fixating on the target.  \n\nEvery $122835t1 sec. the Pheromones inflict $123092s2 Nature damage to all players and Pungency on the target, then spawn a Pheromone Trail.\n\nPheromones pass to allies in close proximity."},
			{id=6268,title="Pungency",body="Exposure to Garalon's Pheromones renders the player extra pungent, increasing Pheromone damage by $123081s1% for $123081d. This effect stacks."},
			{id=6269,title="Pheromone Trail",body="The Pheromone Trail on the ground inflicts $123120s1 Nature damage to players within $123120A1 yards."},
			{id=6270,title="Garalon's Legs",body="Players attack Garalon's legs separately from his body."},
			{id=6271,title="Weak Point",body="Close proximity to Garalon's leg allows attackers to see weak points, increasing their damage dealt to the leg by $123423s1%."},
			{id=6272,title="Broken Leg",body="Breaking one of Garalon's legs damages Garalon for $122786s3% of his maximum health and reduces Garalon's movement speed by $122786s1%.  This effect stacks up to $122786U times."},
			{id=6273,title="Mend Leg",body="Garalon periodically mends one of his broken legs, restoring it to full health."},
			{id=6294,title="Damaged",body="In Heroic difficulty, Garalon gains the Damaged effect upon reaching 33% remaining health.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=6295,title="Pheromones",body="While Garalon has the Damaged effect, Garalon ignores the fixate effects of Pheromones.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
			{id=6296,title="Melee Attack",body="While Garalon has the Damaged effect, Garalon uses his normal melee attack and gains a dramatic speed increase.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
		},
	},
