			{id=6205,title="Quick-Dry Resin",body="Ner'onok sprays a target with heated resin. As the resin hardens it inflicts $121447s1 Fire damage every $121447t1 sec. If this process completes the target becomes encased in resin and cannot move or act for $121448d. \n\nJumping counteracts this effect and if the target breaks free they become Invigorated, increasing casting and movement speeds by $121449s1% for $121449d."},
