		sections={
			{id=7128,title="Call of Tortos",body="Tortos lets out a rumbling call, causing several smaller turtles to enter the area and attack players."},
			{id=7129,title="Whirl Turtle"},
			{id=7130,title="Spinning Shell",body="The turtle chases players around the room, spinning rapidly and continuously inflicting $134011s1 Physical damage to enemies within $133974s1 yards, knocking them away."},
			{id=7131,title="Shell Block",body="The turtle hides in his shell at low health, gaining immunity to all damage. While in this state, the turtle can be kicked across the room by players, applying Shell Concussion to any creatures it hits along the way."},
			{id=7826,title="Kick Shell",body="This extra action button can be used to kick a defeated Whirl Turtle across the room. Move close to the shell, then aim by positioning it between yourself and your target. Enemies hit by the shell are afflicted by Shell Concussion."},
			{id=7134,title="Shell Concussion",body="When kicked, the shell spins forward, interrupting enemies it touches and leaving them off-balance, increasing the damage they take from all sources by $136431s2% for $136431d."},
			{id=7135,title="Furious Stone Breath",body="Inflicts $133946s1 Nature damage to all enemies every $133939t1 sec for $133939d. Costs 100 Fury to cast."},
			{id=7841,title="Growing Fury",body="Tortos becomes angry when no enemies are in melee range, gaining $136010s2 Fury."},
			{id=7137,title="Rockfall",body="A lightning-charged stalactite falls from the roof of the cave, inflicting $134539s1 Nature damage to enemies within $134539A1 yards and $134476s1 Nature damage to enemies within $134476A1 yards."},
			{id=7138,title="Quake Stomp",body="Tortos performs a massive stomp, stunning all enemies for $134920d and inflicting Physical damage to each equal to $134920s1% of their maximum health. Quake Stomp also increases the frequency of Rockfalls for $134915d."},
			{id=7139,title="Snapping Bite",body="Tortos snaps his jaws shut around the target, inflicting $135251s1 Physical damage."},
			{id=7140,title="Vampiric Cave Bat"},
			{id=7141,title="Drain the Weak",body="Drains health when attacking targets with less than $135103s1 current health, inflicting $135101s1% of weapon damage as Physical and healing the caster for $135102s1 times the damage dealt."},
			{id=7171,title="Crystal Shell",body="The crystal reacts when struck, encasing the attacker in a shell that absorbs incoming damage and healing. Initially the shell can absorb up to $137633s2% of max health in damage, but healing absorbed by the shell is added to this total, up to a cap of $137648s2% of max health. The shell breaks when it cannot absorb any more damage.",difficultyIDs={5,6}},
		},
	},
	[826]={
