		sections={
			{id=9251,title="Overview",body="Garrosh calls in Kor'kron soldiers, while Siege Engineers try to activate Iron Stars that crush players and orcs in their path.\n\nWhen Garrosh reaches 10% health, he draws upon the Heart to heal himself. Garrosh periodically pulls all players into the Realm of Y'Shaarj, where they must interrupt his efforts to draw power from the Heart.\n\nWhen reaching 10% health a second time, Garrosh fully drains the heart, empowering all his abilities until his defeat."},
			{id=9252,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, interrupt Far Seers' casts and kill at least one Siege Engineer per wave.\n$bullet;In the realm of Y'Shaarj, defeat all Sha manifestations to prevent Garrosh from gaining energy.\n$bullet;Damage afflicted players to break the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145065|h[Touch of Y'Shaarj]|h|r, and interrupt them to prevent the affliction from spreading.\n$bullet;Once Garrosh reaches 25 energy, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145037|h[Empowered Whirling Corruption]|h|r spawns Minions of Y'Shaarj that gain great power if killed near each other."},
			{id=9253,title="Healers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:144798|h[Exploding Iron Stars]|h|r deal heavy raidwide damage that decreases with distance from the impact point.\n$bullet;Once Garrosh's shield in the Realm of Y'Shaarj is broken, his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:144969|h[Annihilate]|h|r will deal heavy raidwide damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:144985|h[Whirling Corruption]|h|r deals heavy raidwide damage that decreases the farther a target is from Garrosh."},
			{id=9254,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, Garrosh will use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:144821|h[Hellscream's Warsong]|h|r to significantly increase the damage output of his Kor'kron minions.\n$bullet;After leaving the Realm of Y'Shaarj, Garrosh's attacks will inflict |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145183|h[Gripping Despair]|h|r, which increases in damage with each application.\n$bullet;Once Empowered, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:144985|h[Whirling Corruption]|h|r spawns Minions of Y'Shaarj that gain great power if killed near each other."},
			{id=8288,title="Stage One: The True Horde",body="Garrosh, wielding his new weapon with his True Horde and siege machines at his disposal, brings his might to bear upon any intruders. The True Horde join the battle more frequently as the fight progresses. This phase will continue until Garrosh reaches 10% health remaining."},
			{id=8289,title="Garrosh Hellscream",body="Warchief of the True Horde."},
			{id=8290,title="Desecrate",body="Garrosh hurls the Desecrated Weapon at a random enemy, inflicting $144758s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $144758A1 yards and creates a Desecrated Weapon at the location."},
			{id=8304,title="Desecrated Weapon",body="The power of Y'Shaarj seeps from the Desecrated Weapon. As the health of the weapon gets lower, the radius of the Desecrated ground becomes smaller."},
			{id=8291,title="Hellscream's Warsong",body="Hellscream's Warsong inspires his allies, increasing Physical damage dealt by $144821s1% and increasing health by $144821s2%."},
			{id=8292,title="Kor'kron Warbringer",body="Warbringers stream in from the sides of the room and join the battle more frequently as the phase progresses."},
			{id=8293,title="Hamstring",body="Inflicts $144582s1% of normal damage and reduces move speed by $144582s2% for $144582d."},
			{id=8580,title="Blood Frenzied",body="Blood Frenzied causes the Kor'kron Warbringers to attack nearby enemies.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8294,title="Farseer Wolf Rider",body="The Farseers will join the battle less frequently than the grunts, but they too join the battle more frequently as the phase progresses."},
			{id=8295,title="Ancestral Fury",body="Being interrupted causes Fury, increasing cast speed by $144588s1%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8296,title="Ancestral Chain Heal",body="$bullet;Heals a friendly target for a percentage of their max health, chaining to nearby friendly targets."},
			{id=8297,title="Chain Lightning",body="Inflicts $144584s1 Nature damage, chaining to nearby enemies."},
			{id=8298,title="Siege Engineer",body="The Siege Engineers enter from the side balcony and begin to power the Iron Star which will become active after $144616d if the Siege Engineer is not killed."},
			{id=8300,title="Kor'kron Iron Star",body="After becoming activated by the Siege Engineers the Iron Star will roll across the room, slamming into the opposite wall."},
			{id=8301,title="Iron Star Impact",body="Inflicts massive damage to any players or Kor'kron that are caught in its path, knocking them back."},
			{id=8302,title="Exploding Iron Star",body="The impact of the Iron Star causes it to explode, inflicting $144798s1 Fire damage to nearby enemies. The damage inflicted decreases the farther away an enemy is from the explosion."},
			{id=8305,title="Intermission: Realm of Y'Shaarj",body="Periodically the call of Y'Shaarj will transport Garrosh and the players into the Realm of Y'Shaarj for $144954d. Garrosh will heal for $144945s3% of his total health and begin to Absorb Energy from the Heart of Y'Shaarj until players have defeated all Minions of Y'Shaarj inside the realm and interrupt Garrosh."},
			{id=8326,title="Y'Shaarj's Protection",body="Immune to damage. Defeating the Sha minions will dispel the protection. While under the protection of Y'Shaarj, Garrosh will absorb energy from the Heart."},
			{id=8306,title="Annihilate",body="After Absorb Power is interrupted Garrosh will cast Annihilate, inflicting $144969s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $144969A1 yards in front of Garrosh and $144969s2 Shadow damage to all enemies in the Realm of Y'Shaarj."},
			{id=8327,title="Embodied Fear",body="Found in the Terrace of Endless Spring. Once all Embodied Fear are defeated Y'Shaarj's Protection will fade from Garrosh."},
			{id=8477,title="Consumed Courage",body="Causes Courage to spawn nearby when the Embodied Fear is defeated. Courage reduces damage taken by $148983s1%."},
			{id=8577,title="Crushing Fear",body="While in the Terrace of the Endless Spring, random enemies are targeted with Crushing Fear. Crushing Fear inflicts $147324s1 Shadow damage and inflicts fear on enemies within $147324A1 yards for $147324d.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8328,title="Embodied Doubt",body="Found in the Temple of the Jade Serpent. Once all Embodied Doubt are defeated Y'Shaarj's Protection will fade from Garrosh."},
			{id=8478,title="Consumed Faith",body="Causes Faith to spawn nearby when the Embodied Doubt is defeated. Faith reduces damage taken by $148994s1%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8578,title="Embodied Doubt",body="Any Embodied Doubt in the Temple of the Jade Serpent will cast Embodied Doubt, inflicting $149347s1 Shadow damage to all enemies within the realm of Y'Shaarj. Increases damage taken by Embodied Doubt by $149347s2%. Stacks.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8329,title="Embodied Despair",body="Found in the Temple of the Red Crane. Once both Embodied Despair are defeated Y'Shaarj's Protection will fade from Garrosh."},
			{id=8479,title="Consumed Hope",body="Causes Hope to spawn nearby when the Embodied Despair is defeated. Hope reduces damage taken by $149004s1%."},
			{id=8579,title="Ultimate Despair",body="Death of an Embodied Despair causes the other to cast Ultimate Despair. Inflicting $147342s1 Shadow damage and increases damage taken by Ultimate Despair by $147342s2%. Stacks.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8307,title="Stage Two: Power of Y'Shaarj",body="After absorbing the Power of Y'Shaarj, Garrosh will heal to full health as Y'Shaarj's blood grants Garrosh new powers."},
			{id=8308,title="Whirling Corruption",body="Garrosh begins whirling, inflicting $144989s1 Shadow damage to nearby enemies every $144989t1 sec. The damage inflicted decreases the farther away the enemy is from Garrosh.\n\nWhen Garrosh reaches 25 Energy, Whirling Corruption becomes Empowered."},
			{id=8309,title="Empowered Whirling Corruption",body="At 25 Energy the Empowered Whirling Corruption will periodically fire a missile at a player inflicting $145033s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $145033A1 yards and creates a Minion of Y'Shaarj at the location."},
			{id=8310,title="Minion of Y'Shaarj",body="A minion of Y'Shaarj will cast Empowering Corruption when it is killed. Empowering Corruption heals nearby Minions of Y'Shaarj to full and increases max health by $145043s3% and increases damage dealt by $145043s1%. Stacks.$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, each Minion of Y'Shaarj gains 10 energy when it deals melee damage. Upon reaching 100 energy, or when the Minion of Y'Shaarj dies, it casts Empowering Corruption.$]"},
			{id=8311,title="Touch of Y'Shaarj",body="Garrosh will afflict players with Touch of Y'Shaarj. Touched players will try to spread the Touch of Y'Shaarj. Touch of Y'Shaarj is removed when the player is reduced to 20% of max health.\n\nWhen Garrosh reaches 50 Energy, Touch of Y'Shaarj becomes Empowered."},
			{id=8312,title="Empowered Touch of Y'Shaarj",body="At 50 Energy, Garrosh will afflict players with Empowered Touch of Y'Shaarj, transforming them into a Sha that is immune to loss of control effects and has increased health. Touched players will try to spread the Touch of Y'Shaarj. Touch of Y'Shaarj is removed when the player is reduced to 20% of max health."},
			{id=8313,title="Desecrate",body="Garrosh hurls the Desecrated Weapon at a random enemy, inflicting $144758s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $144758A1 yards and creates a Desecrated Weapon at the location.\n\nWhen Garrosh reaches 75 Energy, Desecrate becomes Empowered."},
			{id=8314,title="Desecrated Weapon",body="The power of Y'Shaarj seeps from the Desecrated Weapon. As the health of the weapon gets lower, the radius of the Desecrated ground becomes smaller."},
			{id=8315,title="Empowered Desecrate",body="At 75 Energy, Garrosh creates an Empowered Desecrated Weapon that gains Power of Y'Shaarj, causing it to become indestructible and regain health over time."},
			{id=8316,title="Gripping Despair",body="Gripping Despair inflicts $145183s1 Shadow damage every $145183t1 sec for $145183d. This effect stacks.\n\nWhen Garrosh reaches 100 Energy, Gripping Despair becomes Empowered."},
			{id=8319,title="Stage Three: MY WORLD",body="Upon reaching 10% health a second time, Garrosh will absorb the remaining power of Y'Shaarj, gaining full energy, healing and empowering all of his abilities."},
			{id=8320,title="Empowered Whirling Corruption",body="Empowered Whirling Corruption will periodically fire a missile at a player, inflicting $145033s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $145033A1 yards and creating a Minion of Y'Shaarj at the location."},
			{id=8321,title="Minion of Y'Shaarj",body="A minion of Y'Shaarj will cast Empowering Corruption when it is killed. Empowering Corruption heals nearby Minions of Y'Shaarj to full and increases max health by $145043s3% and increases damage dealt by $145043s1%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8322,title="Empowered Touch of Y'Shaarj",body="Garrosh will afflict players with Empowered Touch of Y'Shaarj, transforming them into a Sha that is immune to loss of control effects and has increased health. Touched players will try to spread the Touch of Y'Shaarj. Touch of Y'Shaarj is removed when the player is reduced to 20% of max health."},
			{id=8323,title="Empowered Desecrate",body="Garrosh hurls the Empowered Desecrated Weapon at a random enemy, inflicting $144758s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $144758A1 yards and creates an Empowered Desecrated Weapon at the location which gains Power of Y'Shaarj, causing it to become indestructible and regain health over time."},
			{id=8324,title="Empowered Gripping Despair",body="Empowered Gripping Despair inflicts $145195s1 Shadow damage every $145195t1 sec for $145195d. When Empowered Gripping Despair expires or is removed it causes Explosive Despair."},
			{id=8325,title="Explosive Despair",body="Inflicts Shadow damage equal to the value of Gripping Despair. Increases damage taken by Explosive Despair by $145213s2% for each stack of Empowered Gripping Despair when it expired or was removed."},
		},
	},
	[870]={
		encounterID=870,
		instanceID=369,
		order=10,
		name="Spoils of Pandaria",
		lore="When Garrosh gazed across Pandaria, he saw untapped power. During the course of his campaign, Garrosh has plundered weapons, treasures, and artifacts of the pandaren, the mogu, and the mantid. They are kept in a warehouse deep within his underground base, guarded by a mysterious security system that appears to be of Titan origins.",
		dungeonEncounterID=1594,
		uiMapID=564,
		pin={x=0.5278,y=0.2925},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17,241},
		npcIDs={71889},
		displayIDs={51173},
		loot={
			{itemID=112825,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112826,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112827,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112828,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112829,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112831,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112832,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112833,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112834,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112835,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112836,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112837,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112838,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112839,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112841,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112842,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112843,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112844,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112845,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112846,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112847,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=8350,title="Overview",body="Players trigger the self-destruct mechanism in a Kor'kron treasure storage. Breaking open crates and defeating the enemies contained inside releases Titan Energy that charges manual override levers that are used to shut down the defense system before it destroys the storeroom and everyone trapped inside. \n\nTwo of the four quadrants of the room are accessible initially, and the other half is unlocked once the first two override levers are pulled. Activating and pulling all four levers completes the encounter."},
			{id=10225,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Destroy Stone Statues summoned by mogu elders to minimize the effects of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145998|h[Strength of the Stone]|h|r.\n$bullet;If a mantid commander afflicts you with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145996|h[Set to Blow]|h|r, drop the explosive charges away from your allies.\n$bullet;Stand in Anima Golems' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145288|h[Matter Scramble]|h|r rings to prevent an explosion."},
			{id=10226,title="Healers",body="$bullet;The mogu and mantid champions that emerge from Large Crates deal raidwide damage while active.\n$bullet;Stand in Anima Golems' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145288|h[Matter Scramble]|h|r rings to prevent an explosion."},
			{id=10227,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Be ready to tank the enemies that emerge from each crate as they are opened.\n$bullet;Modified Anima Golems' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:145271|h[Crimson Reconstitution]|h|r pools will heal any enemies that remain within them."},
			{id=8351,title="Massive Crate of Goods",body="These massive crates of goods carry monstrous war-torn creatures. A large amount of Titan Energy powers them, but it may take considerable effort to defeat them."},
			{id=8436,title="Mogu Crate"},
			{id=8352,title="Shao-Tien Elder Council"},
			{id=8394,title="Return to Stone",body="Drains some of the life essence from players, knocking them back and inflicting $145514s1 Shadow damage and forming a stone statue from that essence.\n\nThese statues frequently strike the ground, inflicting $145523s1 Physical damage and stunning targets in a frontal cone for $145523D.\n\nThese statues remain until killed."},
			{id=8393,title="Strength of the Stone",body="Increases damage dealt by $145998s1% and an additional $145998s1% for each Stone Statue alive."},
			{id=8462,title="Jun-Wei"},
			{id=8463,title="Shadow Volley",body="Ushers great power of Shadow origin, inflicting $148515s1 Shadow damage to all nearby players."},
			{id=8460,title="Zu Yin"},
			{id=8466,title="Molten Fist",body="Unleashes his burning fists, slinging orbs of flame at nearby opponents, inflicting $148518s1 Fire damage."},
			{id=8461,title="Xiang-Lin"},
			{id=8467,title="Jade Tempest",body="Combines the immense power of Jade Flame with the destructive force of Thunder, inflicting $148582s1 Firestorm damage to all nearby players."},
			{id=8464,title="Kun-Da"},
			{id=8465,title="Fracture",body="Smashes the ground with his mighty blade. This strike is so powerful that it inflicts $148513s1 Nature damage to all nearby players."},
			{id=8437,title="Mantid Crate"},
			{id=8353,title="Mantid Commanders"},
			{id=8392,title="Set to Blow",body="Throws a pack of highly volatile bombs on the back of players. After $145987D, these bombs will detonate, inflicting $145993s1 Fire damage per remaining stack to all players within $145993A1 yards. \n\nPlayers may use Throw Bomb to remove one of these bombs, dropping it on the ground at their feet instead. Bombs on the ground will detonate, inflicting $145993s1 Fire damage to anyone within $145993A1 yards when any player enters their close proximity or after $146365D.\n\nThe explosion from any of these bombs can chain to nearby ground bombs."},
			{id=8481,title="Pheromone Cloud",body="Inflicts $148760s1 Nature damage every second while alive."},
			{id=8354,title="Stout Crate of Goods",body="These hefty crates of goods carry seasoned enemies. A medium amount of Titan Energy fuels their animation and caution should be taken to defeat them."},
			{id=8438,title="Mogu Crate"},
			{id=8355,title="Modified Anima Golem"},
			{id=8371,title="Matter Scramble",body="Highlights several locations on the ground which will scramble the locations of players standing inside them. If the Golem attempts to scramble a location with no players, the fabric of space tears, inflicting $145393s1 Fire damage to players within $145393A1 yards."},
			{id=8372,title="Crimson Reconstitution",body="Creates voids of magic around nearby units for $145270D. Any enemies which remain in the void are healed for $145271s1% of their maximum health every second."},
			{id=8534,title="Crimson Acid",body="Adds a harsh acid to the Crimson Reconstitution anima pools. Any players which remain in the pool are damaged for $149280s1 Fire damage every second.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8356,title="Mogu Shadow Ritualist",body="The soul of a powerful Shao-Tien Archritualist emerges to defend his phylactery. Any damage inflicted to the Archritualist is copied to the phylactery, and defeating either destroys the other."},
			{id=8373,title="Torment",body="Torments a target with the pain wrought from a thousand years of isolation, inflicting $142983s2 Shadow damage immediately and additional Shadow damage every second until dispelled. This damage increases over time.\n\nEach time Torment is dispelled, it jumps to a nearby target, inflicts the initial damage, and resets the damage increase. Torment is removed once the Mogu Shadow Ritualist is defeated."},
			{id=8370,title="Mogu Rune of Power",body="Etches a rune of power on the ground under nearby units for $145460D. Any targets which remain on the rune gain increased melee, ranged, and spell haste by $145458s1%."},
			{id=8404,title="Forbidden Magic",body="Inflicts $145240s1 Arcane damage every second while channeling."},
			{id=8439,title="Mantid Crate"},
			{id=8357,title="Zar'thik Amber Priest"},
			{id=8374,title="Mantid Swarm",body="Rallies additional Zar'thik Mantid to his aid."},
			{id=8375,title="Residue",body="Applies a thick layer of restorative amber residue to nearby friendly targets, healing them for $145790s1 health every $145790T1 sec., divided evenly amongst all targets."},
			{id=8358,title="Set'thik Wind Wielder"},
			{id=8376,title="Windstorm",body="Creates a torrent of wind that moves around in a spiral. Colliding with the torrent inflicts $145817s1 Nature damage. The torrent lasts for $145286D and increases in speed over time."},
			{id=8377,title="Rage of the Empress",body="Rallies nearby friendly targets, increasing all damage dealt by $145813s1%, divided evenly amongst all targets."},
			{id=8359,title="Lightweight Crate of Goods",body="These small crates of goods carry front-line enemy forces. A small amount of Titan Energy fuels their creation and can be defeated with fewer players."},
			{id=8434,title="Mogu Crate"},
			{id=8360,title="Animated Stone Mogu"},
			{id=8379,title="Harden Flesh",body="Hardens the flesh of targets over $145218D, inflicting $145218s2 Physical damage every second and slowing by $145218s1%. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8406,title="Earthen Shard",body="Summons a shard of earthen material, striking a target for $144923s1 Nature damage."},
			{id=8361,title="Burial Urn"},
			{id=8380,title="Spark of Life",body="Creates a Spark of Life, which periodically pulses an electrically charged cloud, inflicting $142759s1 Nature damage to enemies within $142759A1 yards.\n\nDefeating the Spark of Life invokes a Nova, immediately inflicting $142775s1 Nature damage to enemies within $142775A1 yards."},
			{id=8362,title="Quilen Guardians"},
			{id=8381,title="Carnivorous Bite",body="Each Quilen Guardian may bite a target, inflicting $144853s1 Physical damage every $144853T1 sec. for $144853D. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8435,title="Mantid Crate"},
			{id=8363,title="Sri'thik Bombardier"},
			{id=8383,title="Gusting Bomb",body="Slides a bomb towards a distant target, inflicting $145718s1 Nature damage to enemies within $145718A1 yards of that target. This fast-moving bomb leaves behind a trail of wind, inflicting $145716s1 Nature damage every second for $145714D."},
			{id=8407,title="Throw Explosives",body="Tosses specialized bombs that immediately explode for $145706s1 Physical damage to targets within $145706A1 yards."},
			{id=8364,title="Amber-Encased Kunchong"},
			{id=8384,title="Encapsulated Pheromones",body="Periodically expels a trail of Encapsulated Pheromones in the direction of nearby foes, inflicting $145748s1 Fire damage every second to enemies standing in the Encapsulated Pheromone pool."},
			{id=8365,title="Kor'thik Warcaller"},
			{id=8385,title="Enrage",body="Periodically enrages, increasing damage dealt by $145692s1% but decreasing movement speed. While enraged, attacks have a chance to shatter the armor of his target, decreasing their armor by $148510s1% for $148510D. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8366,title="Crate of Pandaren Relics",body="These small crates of goods carry rare artifacts of Pandaren origin. Titan Energy does not fuel their animation, instead they are guarded by powerful Pandaren spirits.",difficultyIDs={14,15,16}},
			{id=8386,title="Ancient Brewmaster Spirit",body="Upon reaching low health, the Ancient Brewmaster Spirit allows players to consume the weapon's blessing."},
			{id=8387,title="Keg Toss",body="Hurls a keg at a distant target, inflicting $146217s1 Nature damage to enemies within $146217A1 yards and slowing targets hit by $146217s2% for $146217d."},
			{id=8388,title="Breath of Fire",body="Bellows out a channel of fire for $146222D, inflicting $146226s1 Fire damage. If the target is afflicted with Keg Toss, they are additionally disoriented and take $146230s1 Fire damage every second for $146235D."},
			{id=8367,title="Blade of the Hundred Steps",body="Imbues all players of the tank role in the current quadrant of this warehouse with a boon.\n\nAttacks have a chance to call down a bolt of lightning, inflicting $146081s1 Nature damage to enemies within $146081A1 yards and stun them for $146081D. This effect bypasses a creature's immunity to stuns and has a 15-second cooldown."},
			{id=8389,title="Wise Mistweaver Spirit",body="Upon reaching low health, the Wise Mistweaver Spirit allows players to consume the weapon's blessing."},
			{id=8468,title="Eminence",body="When the Monk deals damage, she will heal equal to $146190s1% of the damage dealt."},
			{id=8390,title="Gusting Crane Kick",body="The Wise Mistweaver Spirit spins rapidly in a circle, drawing in players within 40 yards and inflicting $143009s1 Physical damage to targets within $143009A1 yards every second for $143007D."},
			{id=8368,title="Staff of Resonating Water",body="Imbues all players of the healer role in the current quadrant of this warehouse with a boon.\n\nHeals have a chance to create a wave of force that travels forward $146098s1 yards. Any friendly targets in the wave's path are healed. The wave also damages enemies for $146679s1 Nature damage.\n\nThe wave dissipates after $146098D.\n\nThis effect has an 8-second cooldown."},
			{id=8391,title="Nameless Windwalker Spirit",body="Upon reaching low health, the Nameless Windwalker Spirit allows players to consume the weapon's blessing."},
			{id=8399,title="Path of Blossoms",body="Charges a distant target, leaving behind a trail of fiery blossoms which on contact, inflict $146257s1 Fire damage to enemies within $146257A1 yards. These blossoms linger for $146255D.\n\nCasts Mass Paralysis upon reaching the distant target's location, stunning any remaining targets within $146289A1 yards for $146289D."},
			{id=8369,title="Claw of Burning Anger",body="Imbues all players of the damage dealer role in the current quadrant of this warehouse with a boon.\n\nAttacks have a chance to damage a target for $146142s1 Fire damage. This effect has a 5-second cooldown."},
			{id=8469,title="Unstable Spark",body="In a last ditch effort, any being animated by the Unstable Titan Energy transforms into a raw Unstable Spark, leaps to a distant quadrant and attempts to go Supernova. Successfully casting Supernova inflicts $146815s1 Nature damage to all nearby enemies.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8398,title="Lift Hook",body="Players may use crate lifting hooks to travel from the warehouse subfloor to the main platform throughout the fight."},
		},
	},
	[881]={
		encounterID=881,
		instanceID=369,
		order=5,
		name="Galakras",
		lore="Warlord Zaela formed a close bond with Garrosh during events in the Twilight Highlands, and she and her Dragonmaw orcs have pledged loyalty to Garrosh's cause. Riding atop the fearsome Galakras, a direct descendant of the cataclysmic progenitor of all dragonkind, Zaela oversees the naval defense of Orgrimmar.",
		dungeonEncounterID=1622,
		uiMapID=559,
		pin={x=0.772,y=0.2969},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17,241},
		npcIDs={72249},
		displayIDs={49337},
		loot={
			{itemID=112703,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112704,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112705,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112706,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112707,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112709,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112710,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112711,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112712,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112713,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112714,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112715,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112716,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112717,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112718,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112719,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112721,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112723,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112725,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112726,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112727,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=112728,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=10199,title="Overview",body="Players assault fortified towers as waves of Kor'kron troops rush forth to repel them, and Warlord Zaela circles overhead on her fearsome proto-drake, Galakras. Meanwhile, allied demolitionists work to breach the doors to the nearby guard towers, allowing a strike team to enter the tower and capture it. Once both towers have been captured, the anti-air guns atop each may be used to bring Galakras down to the ground for a final battle."},
			{id=10200,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Quickly destroy Healing Tide Totems and War Banners.\n$bullet;Interrupt Tidal Shamans' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:146757|h[Chain Heal]|h|r.\n$bullet;If targeted by Galakras's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:146992|h[Flames of Galakrond]|h|r, lead it through your allies to diminish its potency."},
			{id=10201,title="Healers",body="$bullet;When Korgra the Snake reaches 50% health remaining, her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:147713|h[Venom Bolt Volley]|h|r will deal heavy raidwide damage.\n$bullet;If targeted by Galakras's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:146992|h[Flames of Galakrond]|h|r, lead it through your allies to diminish its potency."},
			{id=10202,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Interrupt Tidal Shamans' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:146757|h[Chain Heal]|h|r.\n$bullet;When a tower is breached, one tank must lead a small group of players to clear out remaining Kor'kron."},
			{id=8537,title="Stage One: Bring Her Down!",body="Warlord Zaela sends her finest Dragonmaw soldiers to battle. Two guardians keep watch over the Towers above, protecting the Anti-Air turrets. Defeating these guardians will give players access to the Anti-Air turrets.\n\nTwo well-timed Anti-Air turret shots will send Galakras spiraling towards the ground."},
			{id=8538,title="Ranking Officials"},
			{id=8539,title="Master Cannoneer Dagryn"},
			{id=8540,title="Shoot",body="Dagryn shoots at random players nearby, inflicting heavy damage."},
			{id=8541,title="Muzzle Spray",body="Dagryn unleashes a muzzle flare, inflicting $147824s1 Physical damage multiple times per second, and knocking players back with each hit."},
			{id=8542,title="Lieutenant General Krugruk"},
			{id=8543,title="Thunder Clap",body="With a mighty stomp Krugruk shatters the ground, slowing nearby players' movement speed. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8544,title="Arcing Smash",body="Krugruk rears back his mighty spear, inflicting $147688s1 Physical damage to players in a frontal cone and knocking them back."},
			{id=8545,title="High Enforcer Thranok"},
			{id=8546,title="Shattering Cleave",body="With a mighty swing, Thranok inflicts $146849s1% normal damage to his primary target and additional nearby targets."},
			{id=8547,title="Crusher's Call",body="High Enforcer Thranok lashes out with chains, hooking random players within $146769A1 yards and pulling them to his feet.\n\nAfterwards, Thranok rears back to execute his savage attack, Skull Cracker, that inflicts $146848s2 Physical damage to all players within $146848A2 yards."},
			{id=8548,title="Korgra the Snake"},
			{id=8549,title="Poison-Tipped Blades",body="Korgra's poison-tipped dagger inflicts $146902s1 Nature damage every $146902t1 sec.  to her primary target. This effect stacks."},
			{id=8550,title="Poison Cloud",body="Korgra shatters a vial of poison, causing a smoky poison cloud to coalesce at her feet. This poison cloud inflicts $147705s1 Nature damage every $147705t1 second to players standing within."},
			{id=8551,title="Curse of Venom",body="When her health falls low, Korgra's Curse of Venom takes effect. She will take the form of a snake, casting a deadly poison bolt volley until she is defeated."},
			{id=8552,title="Dragonmaw Ebon Stalker",body="Upon Korgra's command, these stealthed units will emerge from the shadows behind a random target, stabbing wildly. Any victims standing within range of the blows will suffer critical Physical damage."},
			{id=8553,title="Foot Soldiers"},
			{id=8554,title="Dragonmaw Bonecrusher",body="These deadly warriors will charge to a distant faction leader, stunning them. While stunned, they will perform a barrage of deadly attacks to the victim."},
			{id=8555,title="Fracture",body="The Dragonmaw Bonecrusher charges to a distant Faction Leader, stunning them and inflicting $146901s1% of the leader's health every $t1 sec."},
			{id=8556,title="Dragonmaw Tidal Shaman",body="The Dragonmaw Tidal Shaman cast healing spells on their allies, and summon violent Tidal waves to damage their enemies."},
			{id=8557,title="Healing Tide Totem",body="The Dragonmaw Tidal Shaman summons a totem at the Shaman's feet that heals nearby allies for $146755s1% of their total health every $146754t1 seconds for $146754d."},
			{id=8558,title="Dragonmaw Flameslinger",body="These deadly archers shoot fire-tipped arrows at random players. The effect inflicts Fire damage on impact, and then burns the ground and any players standing within."},
			{id=8559,title="Dragonmaw Grunt",body="Dragonmaw Grunts wade into battle, crushing their enemies with devistating blows. They will also hurl a mighty axe at distant enemies."},
			{id=8587,title="Dragonmaw Proto-Drake",body="Dragonmaw Proto-Drakes channel a frontal cone of flame on their enemies."},
			{id=8561,title="Dragonmaw Flagbearer",body="Dragonmaw Flagbearers inspire those around them, dropping a banner that increases melee, ranged, and spell casting speed by $146735s1%. It also increases damage dealt by $146735s3% for all friendly targets within 15 yards for $146735d."},
			{id=8562,title="Kor'kron Demolisher",body="Warlord Zaela turns her siege weapons against her own towers, bombarding those inside. Bombard inflicts $148311s1 Physical damage and knocks down players inside the bombarded tower."},
			{id=8563,title="Allies"},
			{id=8568,title="Lady Jaina Proudmoore"},
			{id=8569,title="Blizzard",body="Jaina calls down a blizzard that lasts $147431d., inflicting $147431s1 Frost damage every $147431t1 sec. to all enemies in a selected area."},
			{id=8570,title="Vereesa Windrunner",body="Vereesa Windrunner fires with precision at her enemies, occasionally striking multiple enemies."},
			{id=8571,title="King Varian Wyrnn",body="King Varian Wrynn devastates his enemies with a storm of swords. He will occasionally taunt enemies to engage them face-to-face."},
			{id=8572,title="Demolition Crew",body="The Demolition crew will attempt to breach the doors barring the Anti-Air towers. If they are not protected, then the door breaching progress will be interrupted.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=8573,title="Stage Two: Galakras, The Last of His Progeny"},
			{id=8574,title="Flames of Galakrond",body="Galakras spews the raw Flames of Galakrond at a random player. Each player through which it passes will suffer $147029s1 Fire damage every $147029t1 second. However, each player it passes through will decrease the severity of the flames, reducing the damage it deals to subsequent players.\n\nWhen the ball of flame reaches its final destination it will erupt, inflicting $146992s1 Fire damage to all players. This damage is also reduced in severity for each player that diminishes the Flame."},
			{id=8575,title="Pulsing Flames",body="Galakras erupts with molten fury, inflicting $147043s1 Fire damage to all players. Each pulse increases Galakras' Fire damage dealt by $147043s2%."},
		},
	},
